      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794408868942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Your task\n1. Connect the components: show how a question travels from the user to an answer\n2. Design the RAG part: how official guidance gets in, where it is stored, how it is retrieved\n3. Show where the Stamp Duty Calculator is used, and what calls it\n4. Add any data stores you need\n5. Add what a production system needs (for example monitoring and security)\n\nName real services or technologies where you can, and be ready to explain your choices.",
      "originalText": "Your task\n1. Connect the components: show how a question travels from the user to an answer\n2. Design the RAG part: how official guidance gets in, where it is stored, how it is retrieved\n3. Show where the Stamp Duty Calculator is used, and what calls it\n4. Add any data stores you need\n5. Add what a production system needs (for example monitoring and security)\n\nName real services or technologies where you can, and be ready to explain your choices.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b03"
    },
