      "updated": 1794408868942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key\nSolid box: a component you are given\nDashed \"?\" box: a gap for you to fill in, rename or delete\nDashed outline: an area of the design\n\nOnly the first few arrows are drawn.\nThe rest of the connections are yours to add.",
      "originalText": "Key\nSolid box: a component you are given\nDashed \"?\" box: a gap for you to fill in, rename or delete\nDashed outline: an area of the design\n\nOnly the first few arrows are drawn.\nThe rest of the connections are yours to add.",
